    "body": "It is supported in Opera (for both Chromium and Presto).\n\nPer https://groups.google.com/a/webmproject.org/forum/#!topic/webp-discuss/J8HLhTaklYE there was some support in Safari for a brief moment but was then removed again?\n\nWebP is mentioned elsewhere in the spec. I don't really mind either way for this particular instance but I don't see harm in having it here. :-)\n",
